            <div class="container" style="padding: 10px">
                <h3 class="text-center">DrugCentral <strong> Download </strong></h3><br>
                <h4 style="color: black;margin: 40px"><a href="/ActiveDownload"><u>Download Database
                    dump  09/25/2026</u></a>
                    - Contains all information in DrugCentral.<br>
                    The website database runs PostgreSQL 16.15. The download date above refers to the published database dump.<br>
                    This download is a PostgreSQL custom-format archive (.pgdump).
                    Restore it with <code>pg_restore</code> into a PostgreSQL database with the RDKit extension available. See the
                    <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/16/">PostgreSQL 16 documentation</a> for installation,
                    configuration and database restore instructions.<br><br>
                    <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/unmtransinfo/drugcen-2027-db">DrugCentral database Docker image</a>
                    is also available on Docker Hub.<br>
                    Restoring the database dump requires the RDKit PostgreSQL cartridge to be installed on the PostgreSQL server,
                    including when PostgreSQL runs in Docker. See the
                    <a href="https://www.rdkit.org/docs/Cartridge.html">RDKit cartridge documentation</a> and the
                    <a href="https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit/blob/master/Code/PgSQL/rdkit/README.md">cartridge source and installation instructions</a>.<br><br>
                    Also available via public instance at drugcentral:unmtid-dbs.net:5433, username="drugman", password="dosage", with responsiveness depending on user load.


</h4>

